{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Man vs. Machine"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Cyborgs and Robots"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modal Verbs for Speculation"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>You can use modals to talk about degrees of certainty.</p>You use them to describe what is definite, probable, possible, or impossible from the speaker's point of view."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">must</span>, <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">might</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to describe degrees of certainty."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Must = You are quite sure / It's a good guess<br/>Couldn't / Can't = You are quite sure it's not / It's a good guess it's not<br/>May / Might / Can / Could = maybe<br/>May not / Might not = maybe it's not"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Modal</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Soon hospitals could start using robots.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"maybe they will start using robots\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Social robots might become companions.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"maybe they will be companions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The robots may not look like the ones we see in movies.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"maybe they will not look like movie robots\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>You use wish to talk about things you do not have/do or cannot have/do.</p>You use the second conditional to talk about situations that are possible, but not likely."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The second conditional can be used in the affirmative, negative and interrogative forms:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Second Conditional</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If we went early, we could get good seats.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interrogative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could we get good seats if we went early?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We could get good seats even if we went early.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Wouldn't every child wish they had a robot as a friend if it were possible?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Wouldn't the elderly enjoy having someone to keep them company if they could?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Today, if you had trouble eating, a robot could feed you."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you were paralyzed, a robotic exoskeleton walking apparatus would help you walk."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "disabled"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "physically or mentally challenged"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In Japan robots already help the physically disabled."}, {"type": "audio", "c