w them to perceive light. Bionic eyes can't restore sight yet, but, in time, they may.", "id": 3, "image": ""}, {"time": "60500", "text": "Robots have arrived. They may not look like the ones we see in movies. Nevertheless, they are here among us.", "id": 4, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn7le05ob07re2vid01"}}], "id": 2, "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}